## PIPELINE & WORKFLOW
- **Run pipeline:** `cd house-plan && python3 pipeline.py --all` (or `--images`, `--pdfs`, `--sync`, `--context`)
- **PDF generation:** Must use `python3 pipeline.py --pdfs` (not `python3 generate_pdfs.py` directly — fpdf is in the venv at `../.venv/bin/python3`)
- **3D sync:** After editing `3d-viewer/index.html`, run `cp 3d-viewer/index.html docs/viewer.html`
- **Push to GitHub:**
  ```
  gh auth switch --user rakshith-ponnappa
  git add -A && git commit -m "message" && git push
  gh auth switch --user zz-spr-ext_fiveb
  ```
- **Local dev server:** `cd 3d-viewer && python3 -m http.server 8899`

## 3D INTERACTIVE VIEWER
- **Location:** `3d-viewer/index.html` — single-file HTML app
- **Tech:** Three.js r0.164.1 (ES modules via CDN), OrbitControls, PBR materials
- **Camera:** Position (16,7,-5), FOV 45°, window.innerWidth sizing
- **Features:** Orbit/zoom/pan, room click→fly-to + detail popup, explode view (GF/FF separation), roof toggle, X-Ray (transparent walls), day/night mode, section cut, floor selector (All/GF/FF/Site)
- **peekWalls():** Auto-transparent walls when camera is inside a room (bounding box intersection) — lets you see bathroom interiors
- **Data:** All room dimensions, Vastu directions, wall finishes, flooring, features per room
- **Heritage:** Laterite bedrooms tagged with Kodagu Ainmane heritage badge + ಜಂಬಿಟ್ ಕಲ್ಲು description
- **Site:** Plot boundary, compound wall, road, driveway, trees, garage, coffee drying yard, Tulsi Vrindavan
- **Serve:** `cd 3d-viewer && python3 -m http.server 8899` → open http://localhost:8899

